<% content_for :title, "Frequently Asked Questions - Jeeni Shop" %>

<div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem;">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
    <span style="font-size: 3rem;">❓</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--secondary); margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1rem;">Find answers to common questions about our products, ordering, and shipping</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
    <!-- Q1 -->
    <div class="card" style="background: white; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Q: What is Jeeni Millet Health Mix?</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">A: Jeeni Millet Health Mix is a nutritious blend of multiple millets, grains, nuts, and traditional spices designed to offer a complete, balanced meal replacement or breakfast supplement. It is pure, wholesome, and vegetarian.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Q2 -->
    <div class="card" style="background: white; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Q: How do I prepare the health mix?</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">A: Mix 1½ tablespoons of Jeeni Millet Health Mix in 250ml of water or milk to avoid lumps. Cook on a low flame for 5–7 minutes, stirring continuously. Serve hot. You may add a sweetener like jaggery or honey if preferred.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Q3 -->
    <div class="card" style="background: white; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Q: Do you ship all across India?</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">A: Yes! We deliver to all pincodes across India. Standard shipping takes between 3 to 7 business days depending on your location.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Q4 -->
    <div class="card" style="background: white; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Q: What payment options do you support?</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">A: We support online payments (Cards, UPI, Netbanking, Wallets) via Razorpay secure checkout, as well as Cash on Delivery (COD) for selected regions.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Q5 -->
    <div class="card" style="background: white; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Q: Are there any artificial colors or preservatives?</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">A: Absolutely not. All our millet health mixes, baby foods, and traditional blends are completely pure, free from artificial colorings, chemical preservatives, and synthetic additives.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem;">
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">🔙 Return to Shop</a>
  </div>
</div>
